What the issue is (short answer)
Nothing is wrong with the data or the libraries.
The problem is that your SAS job assumes an old campaign table naming format, but the actual Optimize tables were renamed, so your code can no longer:

find the right campaign tables, or
correctly extract the date and time from the table names.

As a result, no campaign data is ever appended, and everything downstream ends up empty.

