One‑sentence root cause

The Optimize APN table naming convention changed, but the job still uses fixed‑position string parsing and hard‑coded campaign lists, causing all passed‑lead data to be silently excluded.


Why this happened now
This is a classic operational failure mode:

Campaign volume grew
Versioning (Vxx, Mxx) was added
Time was embedded in table names
The job was never updated to be resilient

No one broke the data — the code aged out.

